  m_text: Managing my time has always been difficult for me, even as a child. Regular
    alarms helped me stay on track and jolt me back to reality if I got too distracted.
    Throughout my life I have moved on to using my phone and smart watch but this
    small digital clock was a lifeline for me.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
