  m_text: I found this CD player in our roofspace one day and stole it for my room,
    along with a stack of CD's. Eye to the Telescope by KT Tunstall was one of these
    and I played it on repeat, any time I hear these songs now I get hit with 2000s
    nostalgia. Use the buttons on the stereo to explore the album.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f675742eaf9c20a4f909d78ee7a14fed, type: 2}
