  m_text: 'I think I was around twelve years old when I read the first book in the
    Skulldiggery Pleasant series. I have since lost track of how many times I have
    re-read them, but plenty enough to know that they were my favourite books for
    a very long time and will always have a place in my heart. THEY ROCKKK!!!

'
